      "status": "failed",
      "failingExample": "actions=[('trigger', 'game_day'), ('advance', 44), ('reset', None)], seed=0\n\nRepro (zone_ids=SMALL_ZONES, history_days=2):\n  trigger game_day at 15:01:01 EDT  -> expires_at = 15:46:01 EDT\n  advance 44 min -> 15:45:01 EDT (scenario still active)\n  reset at 15:46:01 EDT\n\nExpected (design Property 20 / Req 13.10): after a reset at time r, no injected\nsession is active at or after r.\nActual: 116 injected sessions from the game_day scenario are still active after\nthe reset.\n\nRoot cause: advance_to -> _after_advance() deactivates the scenario on expiry\n(now >= expires_at) by setting self._scenario = None but does NOT end the\ninjected sessions. A later apply_scenario('reset') calls _end_scenario(), which\nreturns immediately because self._scenario is already None, so the expired\nscenario's injected sessions are never ended and persist to their natural\nend_time. The same gap applies to a new trigger after expiry (Req 13.11): the\nprior injected sessions survive.\n\nA second shrink of the same bug:\n  actions=[('trigger', 'game_day'), ('advance', 44), ('trigger', 'game_day')], seed=0\n  -> prior injected session still runs past the new trigger time.",
      "lastRunTimestamp": 1792287429887
    }
